  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.8.0 — Adds RequireAuthenticatedUser option to gate all harness routes under\n      /api-test-spark behind authentication (SPA assets, config, remote-spec, and remote-call endpoints).\n      Hardens the remote-spec proxy with proper HttpResponseMessage disposal, ConfigureAwait(false), and\n      ArrayPool buffer management. Config endpoint now emits Vary: Origin alongside Access-Control-Allow-Origin\n      for correct CORS cache safety. CI workflows now run npm run verify (lint + typecheck + build) first for\n      fail-fast frontend validation. Fixes sticky namespace header overlap bug in the endpoint list. See\n      CHANGELOG.md for full history.",
